abstract: >-
  Public directory of tax treaties and related instruments concluded by
  France. The dataset records jurisdictions, instrument references, taxes
  covered, selected legal-status notices and links to official sources. Version
  1.0.0 reflects the public directory displayed as of 31 July 2026.
keywords:
  - tax treaties
  - international tax law
  - France
  - legal data
  - double taxation
